        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Something has taken hold of a small city in Poland and it's worse than anyone expected.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victoria is a Hunter, trained to investigate the unexplained and cleanse what others refuse to acknowledge. Her first mission seemed straightforward travel to a quiet town in Poland, look into some disturbances, file a report. It wasn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are wrong. The people are hiding something. And the entities that have claimed this place are not waiting to be found. They are already watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven investigation set across a cursed city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized events and choices that shape Victoria's fate and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of ghostly, demonic and ancient entities to uncover and confront</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs play out the same way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art with a deep atmospheric horror tone</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the curse. Confront the darkness directly when investigation is no longer enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Victoria's first mission. It may be her last.</p>",
